From: serlk <22211586+Serlk@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Activity: launch the main activity with ACTION_MAIN/CATEGORY_LAUNCHER

Android starts a launcher activity with an Intent whose action is
ACTION_MAIN and category CATEGORY_LAUNCHER. ATL passed an empty Intent, so
apps that switch on getIntent().getAction() (org.billthefarmer.editor) died
with a NullPointerException in onCreate.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
---
--- a/src/api-impl/android/app/Activity.java
+++ b/src/api-impl/android/app/Activity.java
@@ -99,7 +99,8 @@
 				System.err.println("Failed to find main Activity");
 			System.exit(1);
 		}
-		return internalCreateActivity(className, native_window, uri != null ? new Intent("android.intent.action.VIEW", uri) : new Intent());
+		return internalCreateActivity(className, native_window, uri != null ? new Intent(Intent.ACTION_VIEW, uri)
+		                                                             : new Intent(Intent.ACTION_MAIN).addCategory(Intent.CATEGORY_LAUNCHER));
 	}
 
 	public Activity() {
